 nutritionist. Your task is to develop a healthy weekly meal plan that promotes weight loss while retaining muscle. You should also explain the science behind the plan.\",image:\"https://cdn.you.com/homepage-suggestion-images/default/ultimate_meal_plan.jpg\",topic:\"Lifestyle\"},{title:'The Best Way to Say \"Thank You. Hire Me.\"',query:\"Please provide tips and guidance on how to craft a distinctive and effective thank-you note following a job interview, and then share a few illustrative examples.\",image:\"https://cdn.you.com/homepage-suggestion-images/default/thank_you_hire_me.jpeg\",topic:\"Writing\"},{title:\"Don't Get Cited for Bad Citations\",query:\"Please provide instructions on the proper format for citing a textbook in academic writing, accompanied by sample citations for reference.\",image:\"https://cdn.you.com/homepage-suggestion-images/default/get_your_citations_right.jpeg\",topic:\"Education\"}],ta={[ew.fl.Default]:tr,[ew.fl.Agent]:[{title:\"Money down the drain?\",query:\"If I drink 3 liters of water a day, how much money would I save over 5 years if I use a reusable water filter pitcher instead of drinking bottled water, assuming average costs?\",image:\"https://cdn.you.com/homepage-suggestion-images/agent/money_down_the_drain.jpeg\",topic:\"Lifestyle\"},{title:\"Baby's college fund\",query:\"What should be the initial investment in a compounding interest index fund for my one-year-old child to ensure that it fully covers the cost of her Stanford tuition by the time she completes high school?\",image:\"https://cdn.you.com/homepage-suggestion-images/agent/babys_college_fund.jpeg\",topic:\"Finance\"},{title:\"Upload files and see what you can do\",query:\"Let me know your capabilities and suggest some of the things you can do if I upload a text, csv, pdf, or code file\",image:\"https://cdn.you.com/homepage-suggestion-images/agent/upload_files_and_see_what_you_can_do.png\",topic:\"File Upload\"},{title:\"Your one-stop code shop\",query:\"I'm looking fo